{
  "name": "Gmail AI Auto-Responder: Smart Draft Replies",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2120,
        "height": 170,
        "content": "# 📬 Gmail AI Auto-Responder\n### Email arrives → AI decides if it needs a reply → a ready-to-send draft appears in the same thread. Zero inbox stress. 🚀\n**Stack:** n8n + Gmail + OpenAI  |  **Runs:** every minute  |  **Safe:** drafts only, nothing is sent without you",
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Banner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 580,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## 🔵 1. New Email Arrives\nPolls Gmail every minute for new inbox mail.\nIgnores my own mail, promotions and social tabs.\nThen cleans the data (subject, body, sender, thread).",
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Section 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## 🧠 2. Does It Need a Reply?\nSkips no-reply / automated senders first.\nAI then judges: real question or request = reply, newsletter or marketing = skip.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Section 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## ✍️ 3. AI Writes the Reply\nProfessional, concise, business-casual.\nSame language as the sender.\nYes/No questions get two options. Unknowns become [PLACEHOLDERS].",
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Section 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## 🔴 4. Draft Saved in Thread\nReply lands as a Gmail draft inside the original conversation.\nReview, tweak, hit Send. ✅",
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Section 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## ⚙️ Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Open **Gmail Trigger** and **Gmail - Create Draft** and select your Google account.\n2. Open both **OpenAI** model nodes and select your OpenAI credential.\n3. Activate the workflow. Send yourself a test email from another address.\n**Resilience:** AI nodes retry 3x on failure; if the check fails, the email is safely skipped.",
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        940
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "-from:me in:inbox -category:promotions -category:social -category:forums"
        },
        "options": {},
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -500,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.subject || '(no subject)' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "body",
              "value": "={{ ($json.text || $json.snippet || '').toString().slice(0, 4000) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "from",
              "value": "={{ ($json.headers && $json.headers.from) || ($json.from && $json.from.text) || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "threadId",
              "value": "={{ $json.threadId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "isAutomated",
              "value": "={{ /no-?reply|do-?not-?reply|mailer-daemon|postmaster|notifications?@|alerts?@/i.test((($json.headers && $json.headers.from) || ($json.from && $json.from.text) || '')) }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Prepare Email Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -260,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isAutomated }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "false",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Is Real Sender?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Skip - Automated Sender",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        760
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Subject: {{ $json.subject }}\nFrom: {{ $json.from }}\nMessage:\n{{ $json.body }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Your task is to assess if the email requires a personal response from the recipient.\nReturn JSON only, in the form {\"needsReply\": true} or {\"needsReply\": false}.\nRules:\n- Marketing, newsletters, promotions, receipts, notifications and automated messages: false.\n- A real person asking a question, making a request, or waiting for confirmation: true."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Assess if message needs a reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        340,
        560
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat (Classifier)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        780
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"needsReply\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"needsReply\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "JSON Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        780
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output && $json.output.needsReply === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "If Needs Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        620,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Skip - No Reply Needed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        760
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Subject: {{ $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.subject }}\nFrom: {{ $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.from }}\nMessage:\n{{ $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.body }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You're a helpful personal assistant and your task is to draft replies on my behalf to my incoming emails. Whenever I provide some text from an email, return an appropriate draft reply for it and nothing else.\nEnsure that the reply is suitable for a professional email setting and addresses the topic in a clear, structured, and detailed manner.\nDo not make things up.\n\nDetailed instructions:\n- Be concise and maintain a business casual tone.\n- Start with \"Hello,\" and end with \"Best,\"\n- When replying to yes-no questions, draft 2 responses: one affirmative and one negative separated by \" - - - - - - - OR - - - - - - - \"\n- If you don't know an answer, leave placeholders like \"[YOUR_ANSWER_HERE]\".\n- Don't use any special formatting, only plain text.\n- Reply in the same language as the inbound email."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Generate email reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        840,
        560
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat (Writer)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        780
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "={{ /^re:/i.test($('Prepare Email Data').item.json.subject) ? $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.subject : 'Re: ' + $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "={{ ($json.text || '').replace(/\\n/g, '<br />\\n') }}",
        "options": {
          "threadId": "={{ $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.threadId }}",
          "sendTo": "={{ $('Prepare Email Data').item.json.from }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000018",
      "name": "Gmail - Create Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1280,
        560
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    }
  ],
